The specific check involving allowed children / allowed content types of the parent (and the treatment of an empty `AllowedContentTypes` list) is not present in the provided excerpt; it resides in the base class implementation of `MapCreate`. The only "NotAllowed"-type status explicitly returned in the shown code is `TemplateNotAllowed` (from `UpdateTemplateAsync`), which validates that a template is permitted for the content type.

